1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,767
Rule nine. When everyone is smiling,
look for the one who isn't.

2
00:00:04,267 --> 00:00:13,033
A small face in the bakery window. A
boy who isn't smiling. He pulls up his
sleeve. A bus ticket, wrapped around
his wrist like a bracelet. Route nine.

3
00:00:13,533 --> 00:00:17,267
I never ate the pie. I just pretend.
They said I could go home after pie.

4
00:00:17,767 --> 00:00:20,700
He got off the bus eleven years ago.
He's still seven.

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,133
Which name do you say?

6
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,567
My mom's. But I can't remember it
anymore. That's the problem.

7
00:00:27,067 --> 00:00:32,400
You have to say a name. A real one.
Before the bell. Out loud. It's the
only thing that works.
